== unmanaged-skew
refusal: create agent: native Codex thread preparation is unavailable (generation-unavailable) and no provider conversation was mutated; refusing to create a managed Agent with no native thread binding. Re-run with --interactive-only for a plain interactive Codex Agent with no native turn control, or make the shared Codex app server attachable with `codex app-server daemon` (the native error names the exact step). Install capability managed-ready: The managed standalone Codex payload was observed. Official Codex CLI capability guidance: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/codex/cli. Native error: Codex generation route: generation-unavailable; operator action: This app server is not daemon-managed. Close every sharing Codex client, then run `codex app-server daemon bootstrap` and rerun diagnostics. The observed `pid` backend requires bootstrap again after reboot. Projmux will not kill or restart it.
